// Eraser diagram type: Cloud Architecture
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

API [icon: fastapi, color: blue]

JobQueue interface [icon: git-merge, color: orange] {
  enqueue job [icon: log-in]
  receive job [icon: log-out]
  extend lease [icon: clock]
  ack or retry [icon: check]
}

Queue backends [icon: shuffle] {
  Postgres option [icon: postgres] {
    UPDATE with FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED [icon: lock]
  }
  Celery option [icon: redis] {
    acks_late and visibility timeout [icon: repeat]
  }
  SQS option [icon: aws-sqs] {
    visibility timeout and DLQ [icon: inbox]
  }
  Kafka option [icon: kafka] {
    consumer group and manual commit [icon: git-commit]
  }
}

Worker [icon: cpu, color: purple]

Correctness in Postgres [icon: postgres, color: green] {
  worker_id lease [icon: key]
  checkpoint_row [icon: bookmark]
  status and counters [icon: flag]
}

API > enqueue job: import_id only
enqueue job > Queue backends
Queue backends > receive job: at-least-once delivery
receive job > Worker
Worker > extend lease: every chunk
Worker > ack or retry: after done or failed
Worker > Correctness in Postgres: guard + checkpoint in same transaction
